<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί-κλᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>twisting round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς πόας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.325b
				</span></i>
			 (pl.) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σώματος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				45d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>breaking round</i> or <i>on</i> something, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῦ αἰθέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάταγμα γιγνόμενον κατὰ περίκλασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(2).436
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wheeling round</i> of an army, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.23.6
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				11.23.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. λαμβάνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Flam.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>change of direction</i>, of winds, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Vent.</u>
				28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>modification</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ κόσμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					2.300
				</span></i>
			 (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Gramm.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ περίκλασιν</span> with the
				<i>circumflex accent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				630.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of ground,
				<i>brokenness, ruggedness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.104.4
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
